WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.801
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.234
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:07.567
President Biden attacked
former President Trump yesterday

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.534
for calling his opponents
"vermin"

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:12.267
and said, quote, "Damn,
he shouldn't be president."

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:13.701
Of course he shouldn't
be president,

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:16.033
but that's what you're using
as evidence?

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.801
How about the four years
he was president?

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:20.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.467
The White House yesterday
released the fifth

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.000
National Climate Assessment.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.667
And if you're wondering
how things are going,

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.501
they said
don't expect a sixth.

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:31.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.868
House Speaker Mike Johnson
yesterday defended former

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:36.300
President Trump's false claims
that the election was stolen

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.200
and said, quote,
"I take him at his word.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.200
I do believe
that he believes that."

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.701
Which is absolutely
the smoothest way

00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:46.033
to call someone crazy.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:47.767
My wife does that to me
all the time.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.434
I'll be like,
"Hey, I'm a great husband!"

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:52.434
"I believe
that you believe that."

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:54.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:56.567
Former House Speaker
Kevin McCarthy

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.501
denied claims yesterday
that he elbowed

00:00:58.501 --> 00:01:00.934
Republican Congressman
Tim Burchett in the back

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:03.067
and added, quote,
"If I would hit somebody,

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.501
they would know I hit them."

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:07.100
I assume 'cause his fist
would bruise.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.567
The House...

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:13.567
[ Laughing ]

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:14.767
Just, like...

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:16.267
Just, like, a weird case

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:19.200
where I don't know
if we needed to see it.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.534
You know, I think if we all
just, like, in our heads,

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:26.400
pictured a bruised fist, not one
of them would be that weird.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:31.234
Bummer is we sent one
of our writers out

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:33.100
to just punch a wall.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.133
The House yesterday passed
a temporary

00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:40.801
government funding bill
that does not include any aid

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.234
for Ukraine or Israel,

00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:44.100
or, frankly, the US.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:48.434
Democratic Senator Joe Manchin
said in an interview yesterday

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.868
that he can't vote next year
for former President Trump.

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:53.200
Wow, that could really hurt
Trump's chances

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.200
in West Virginia.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:58.734
The US Postal Service yesterday

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:01.801
reported a $6.5 billion loss
for the year,

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:04.968
but they got a bold plan
to make it all back.

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:07.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:10.434
Hey, it just takes one.

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:12.601
Just takes one sucker.

00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:15.734
Alaska Senator Lisa Murkowski

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:18.100
criticized Utah Senator
Mitt Romney in a new interview,

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.100
for eating salmon
with ketchup.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.767
To be fair, that's the spiciest
dish you can get in Utah.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:25.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:28.567
The restaurant chain Chili's
yesterday released an ad

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:31.234
that features a new version
of its jingle "Baby Back Ribs,"

00:02:31.234 --> 00:02:33.868
performed by the R&amp;B group
Boyz II Men.

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:36.868
Sounds like Boyz II Men
has got "billz II pay."

00:02:36.868 --> 00:02:39.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.501 --> 00:02:45.167
Says the guy
who did a Verizon ad.

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:46.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:49.133
[Bleep] on my high horse.

00:02:49.133 --> 00:02:51.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:53.868
Former Vice President
Mike Pence yesterday

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:56.067
released a new book titled
"Go Home for Dinner."

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:59.067
Look for it wherever tables
are a little crooked.

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:01.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.367 --> 00:03:03.367
[ Applause ]

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:05.834
That's right, Mike Pence
released a new book,

00:03:05.834 --> 00:03:07.834
titled "Go Home for Dinner."

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:09.167
I guess it's no surprise

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:11.334
he thinks eating out is a sin.

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:13.667
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:21.367
Bruised a couple of fists
with that one.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:25.267
And finally, New York state
education officials

00:03:25.267 --> 00:03:28.067
are reportedly considering
dropping the Regents Exams

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:30.868
as a high school graduation
requi-- requirement, excuse me.

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:33.200
While Massachusetts high schools
are considering

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.534
dropping the breathalyzer.

00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:36.367
[ Laughter ]
And that...

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:39.801
was written by a dude from
Massachusetts -- Scollins!

